		'SEND outcome wording changed in the host while the shared headline still parsed the old entire Sent to line, so delivery prose leaked into headers and queued/waiting/interrupted sends lost the resolved session ID. Terminal item-view had its own Bash-only detail rendering, bypassing shared toolDetails and clipping multiline commands. Reused existing shared formatting rather than introducing tool-specific UI implementations.'
